      "refersTo": "badge-neutral",
      "description": "22px pills; colour only for meaning.",
      "html": "<span class=\"ds-badge\">Pending</span> <span class=\"ds-badge ds-badge-pos\">Paid</span> <span class=\"ds-badge ds-badge-neg\">Overdue</span>",
      "css": ".ds-badge{font-family:'Geist Variable',ui-sans-serif,system-ui,sans-serif;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;height:22px;padding:0 8px;border-radius:9999px;background:var(--hover,#eeeeeb);color:var(--ink-2,#454543);font-size:11px;font-weight:500}.ds-badge-pos{background:var(--positive-soft,#e8f3ec);color:var(--positive,#17794b)}.ds-badge-neg{background:var(--negative-soft,#fbecea);color:var(--negative,#c2352b)}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Summary Tile",
      "kind": "card",
      "refersTo": "panel",
      "description": "Panel with label and change on one line, the figure beneath, comparison at the foot.",
      "html": "<section class=\"ds-tile\"><div class=\"ds-tile-head\"><p class=\"ds-tile-label\">Expenses</p><span class=\"ds-delta-neg\">&#8593; 8.4%</span></div><p class=\"ds-tile-figure\">€18,240.00</p><p class=\"ds-tile-foot\"><b>+€1,412.00</b> vs previous 30 days</p></section>",
      "css": ".ds-tile{font-family:'Geist Variable',ui-sans-serif,system-ui,sans-serif;width:300px;padding:24px;border:1px solid var(--panel-line,#e8e8e5);border-radius:var(--radius-panel,16px);background:var(--surface,#fff);box-shadow:var(--shadow-panel,0 1px 2px rgb(23 23 23 / .04))}.ds-tile-head{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:baseline}.ds-tile-label{margin:0;font-size:14px;color:var(--ink-2,#454543)}.ds-delta-neg{font-size:14px;font-weight:500;color:var(--negative,#c2352b);font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}.ds-tile-figure{margin:6px 0 0;font-size:28px;line-height:34px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:-.025em;color:var(--ink,#171717);font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums lining-nums}.ds-tile-foot{margin:16px 0 0;font-size:13px;color:var(--muted,#6b6b68);font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}.ds-tile-foot b{font-weight:500;color:var(--ink-2,#454543)}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Capsule Bar Chart",
      "kind": "custom",
      "refersTo": "capsule-value",
      "description": "Signature form: ink capsules in pale tracks; reading one steps the others back to 32%.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-caps\"><span class=\"ds-cap\"><i style=\"height:55%\"></i></span><span class=\"ds-cap\"><i style=\"height:72%\"></i></span><span class=\"ds-cap\"><i style=\"height:40%\"></i></span><span class=\"ds-cap\"><i style=\"height:86%\"></i></span><span class=\"ds-cap\"><i style=\"height:62%\"></i></span><span class=\"ds-cap\"><i style=\"height:30%\"></i></span><span class=\"ds-cap\"><i style=\"height:68%\"></i></span></div>",
      "css": ".ds-caps{display:flex;align-items:flex-end;gap:14px;height:180px;padding:8px 0}.ds-cap{position:relative;width:32px;height:100%;border-radius:9999px;background:var(--chart-track,#e6e6e3);transition:background-color .2s}.ds-cap i{position:absolute;left:0;right:0;bottom:0;min-height:32px;border-radius:9999px;background:var(--chart-1,#252525);transition:opacity .2s cubic-bezier(.22,1,.36,1)}.ds-caps:hover .ds-cap i{opacity:.32}.ds-caps .ds-cap:hover i{opacity:1}.ds-caps .ds-cap:hover{background:var(--line-strong,#d6d6d2)}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Chart Tooltip",
      "kind": "custom",
      "refersTo": "chart-tooltip",
      "description": "Floating period readout: income, expenses, net.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-tip\"><p class=\"ds-tip-title\">Tue 14 Oct</p><div class=\"ds-tip-row\"><span><i style=\"background:#252525\"></i>Income</span><b>€2,140.00</b></div><div class=\"ds-tip-row\"><span><i style=\"background:#a3a3a0\"></i>Expenses</span><b>€980.00</b></div><div class=\"ds-tip-row ds-tip-net\"><span>Net</span><b>+€1,160.00</b></div></div>",
